exports[`prompts (§6 Prompts) > prepare_send_request {"draftId":"01J00000000000000000000003"} matches its snapshot and never claims the agent sends 1`] = `"Show the user the draft linked below; read it with draft_get. Show the user every draft you write. Call send_request_create only when the user asks for a send: it freezes the draft as a proposal for the owner, and a sendAt you pass is only a proposed time. The owner approves every send on a paired desktop with their PIN. Once you have made the request, tell the user it waits for their approval there; send_request_status shows its state."`;

